# PAGE RELEASE QUALITY GATE

Performance, SEO, Accessibility и семантика — часть разработки.

Перед готовностью:
`npm run quality:all` → exit 0.

Затем 3 mobile Lighthouse runs.

Порог:
- каждый Mobile Performance >= 90;
- target median >= 95;
- Accessibility >= 95, target 100;
- SEO = 100;
- LCP <= 2.5 s target;
- CLS <= 0.05 target;
- TBT <= 100 ms target.

Mobile < 90 — страница не готова.

Critical path:
- H1/offering/CTA/first-screen media без JS;
- compact critical CSS;
- no mass preload;
- only real critical font/LCP resource gets priority.

Images:
- alt у каждого img;
- meaningful alt для content, alt="" для decorative;
- dimensions;
- srcset/sizes;
- LCP not lazy;
- below-fold lazy;
- no oversized mobile assets.

CSS/JS:
- no builder runtime/public.bundle/duplicate assets;
- minimal JS;
- no library for simple menu/accordion;
- no duplicate handlers.

Accessibility:
- landmarks, headings, contrast, labels, link/button names,
  focus-visible, keyboard, modal focus, touch targets, alt.

SEO/Schema:
- lang/charset/viewport/title/description/canonical/one H1;
- crawlable links;
- correct robots/indexability;
- valid truthful JSON-LD;
- no fake ratings/reviews/offers/prices.

Forms:
- label/name/type/autocomplete;
- one handler;
- real success/error;
- consent;
- no secrets.

Final QA:
360/390/412/430/768/1280/1440 + Console + Network + menu + CTA + forms + popup + FAQ/tabs/slider.
